description: DaisyUI agentlabs theme and Agent Labs brand styling
globs: "**/*.{css,tsx}"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Styling

- Theme: DaisyUI `agentlabs` only (`data-theme="agentlabs"` on `<html>`)
- Prefer DaisyUI semantic utilities: `btn-primary`, `bg-base-100`, `text-base-content`, `border-base-300`
- Brand accent is lime → `primary` / `accent`; errors → `error`
- For custom CSS outside DaisyUI, use `--brand-*` tokens from `app/globals.css`
- Do not hardcode hex colors in components when a theme/brand token exists
- Do not invent parallel color systems or extra DaisyUI themes

```tsx
// ✅ GOOD
<button className="btn btn-primary">Join</button>
<p className="text-base-content/70">Muted copy</p>

// ❌ BAD
<button className="bg-[#d4ff4f] text-[#0b0b10]">Join</button>
```
